+"""CPU-only source/host contracts; NOT kernel, dispatcher or CUDA graph tests.
+
+Run directly with Python/unittest, not vLLM's GPU-loading pytest conftest.
+The real candidate Python source is AST-loaded without its torch import. A
+metadata-only tensor double supplies dtype/shape/stride/address fields; no GPU
+is represented by this double. Function bodies, ContextVar and exception paths
+are unchanged. Kernel factories are never imported or called.
+
+Q03_SOURCE_ROOT optionally selects a candidate checkout. During worktree
+integration, Q03_BRIDGE_ROOT, Q03_MODEL_ROOT and Q03_KERNEL_ROOT can independently
+select source checkouts. These overrides affect reads only.
+"""
+
